              <run fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>Æ          </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book,serif' fontsize='11'>Average variations per product: Average number of variations that each product has across all products (whether or not they have a variation)</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
